@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Actions worker runtime for newer candidates
actor "Repository owner" as Owner
participant "Laravel request runtime" as API
database "PostgreSQL queue and run records" as DB
participant "Dedicated queue worker" as Worker
participant "Controlled Git operations" as Git
Owner -> API : Queue built-in repository checks
API -> DB : Persist run and enqueue job
API --> Owner : Run reference
Worker -> DB : Consume gitforge-actions queue
Worker -> Git : Commit, tree and connectivity checks
Git --> Worker : Check results
Worker -> DB : Persist completion or failure
Owner -> API : Read run status
API -> DB : Retrieve permitted run
API --> Owner : Result
note over Worker : Separate process; supervised by host operator\nNo arbitrary project scripts or CI runner
@enduml
